## Is prevention more expensive than treatment? Quite the opposite

Imagine travelling to a spa not because something hurts, but because you want to make sure nothing starts to hurt. Does that sound like a luxury? In truth it is one of the most sensible investments in your health you can make: time for yourself, movement, sleep and a doctor who gives you their attention without haste.

Spa towns such as Mariánské Lázně (Marienbad) offer a setting in which prevention is not merely a medical term, but an experience.

## What is a preventive spa stay?

Unlike a classic therapeutic cure, where you arrive with a specific diagnosis and a referral from your doctor, a preventive stay focuses on:

- **An initial examination** — a consultation with the spa physician, a basic examination and, depending on the programme, laboratory tests
- **Identifying risks** — blood pressure, weight, metabolic markers, movement habits
- **Movement and regeneration** — treatments and guided exercise that the physician puts together according to your condition
- **Lifestyle adjustments** — consultations with a doctor, a nutrition adviser and a physiotherapist

In Marienbad, preventive care draws on natural healing resources: the [mineral springs](/en/mineral-springs), peloid, natural CO₂ gas and the climate, for which the town has held the status of a climatic spa since 2023. Which treatments belong in your programme is decided by the spa physician at the initial examination.

## Why a spa — and not an ordinary clinic?

Any outpatient clinic can carry out a preventive check-up. A spa, however, offers something a clinic cannot replace:

### Time

Who among us sets aside several days at home purely for ourselves? At the spa it is possible. No e-mails, no obligations. Just you, your body and doctors who give you their unhurried attention.

### Setting

Marienbad lies in a sheltered basin of the Slavkov Forest at an altitude of 630 metres. Forest trails begin a few minutes from every hotel, the air is clean and the silence here is true silence.

### A complete approach

A preventive stay combines examinations with treatments and movement. You do not go home with results alone, but with a concrete plan that you have already begun to put into practice at the spa.

